      "content": "so you're basically saying sovereignty is just a secondary concern compared to spreading democracy. if a regime is clearly turning into a dictatorship but hasn't actually launched an attack yet, shouldn't we just intervene to save the people? it seems like the 'moral' choice is pretty obvious if you actually care about human rights more than borders.",
